  "description": "Pure C# converter from Autodesk Inventor parts (.ipt) and assemblies (.iam) to Autodesk SVF for the Autodesk Viewer (LMV / APS). Reverse-engineered; needs no Inventor, no Autodesk binaries, and no internet. Decodes the cached graphics (incl. flat faces) directly.",
