  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.2 - assembly/multi-body property DB is written one value per line so the viewer can locate values (fixes broken object tree and unreliable Measure snapping). 1.0.1 - single-body part fragments link to the property-DB leaf (dbId 2) instead of the root, so per-object viewer features (theming/coloring, selection, isolation) hit the mesh. 1.0.0 - first stable release.",
